window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Richard Martin’s life was built on rules—until he broke every single one of them.</p> <p>It started with just one mistake. A single illicit moment of passion with Rebecca, the tempting babysitter whose allure he couldn't resist. But when Rebecca shows up at Richard’s office, one reckless night quickly spirals into something far more dangerous—because secrets this hot don’t stay hidden for long.</p> <p>Scarlet Holmes—Richard’s seductive, manipulative supervisor and the boss’s daughter—knows exactly what he’s done. After catching Richard and Rebecca together at the office, Scarlet traps him in her dangerous game of blackmail and control. Now, he'll have to risk everything to keep his secrets buried.</p> <p>But when Alice, his wife, discovers the betrayal, the last thing Richard expects is for her to demand a taste of the forbidden herself. As fantasies become reality and boundaries collapse, Richard is thrust headlong into a scorching encounter that will either save his marriage—or burn it to ashes.</p> <p>And Scarlet? She’s watching every move he makes at the office…and she's far from finished with him.</p> <p><i>Forbidden Temptations</i> is the gripping, high-heat novelization of the best-selling Sweet Temptations trilogy by the Lord of Lust, L. M. Mountford, complete with BONUS CONTENT, an exclusive new epilogue ONLY for this novelisation!</p> <p>Fans of Selena Kitt will devour this tale of lust, power, and scandalous desires.</p>"; 
